{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Darkon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkon</strong> is an <strong>online multiplayer shooter</strong> set in a galactic war for the conquest of Earth. Seven alien warrior species clash in epic battles where strategy, aim, and teamwork decide who will dominate the planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Multiplayer shooter</strong> \u2013 face off against players worldwide in intense online battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7d <strong>7 playable species</strong> \u2013 each with unique abilities and distinct combat styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Earth conquest maps</strong> \u2013 fight across iconic battlegrounds inspired by a planet under siege.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Dynamic gameplay</strong> \u2013 modes that mix skill, strategy, and teamwork.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you lead your species to conquer Earth?<br>Step into battle, prove your aim, and earn more than glory in <strong>Darkon</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985680?t=1760082953","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985680/8c391a018acd90a03baf7cefb97bab2a3119d412/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760082953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985680/03392614a7f48399238a7eb6c3de35f307ca0006/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760082953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985680/03392614a7f48399238a7eb6c3de35f307ca0006/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760082953","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Darkon</h2><p cla